🇹🇭🇺🇸FLASHBACK: My Warning Last Year about US-Backed Thai Opposition Helping to Light Asia on Fire through US-Backed Conflict

VIDEO: https://t.co/wroa7Fhjt5

▪️The current Thai government was opposition until recently - and was openly working with the US government to destabilize the region through regime change operations including armed conflict in neighboring Myanmar;

▪️This video discusses irrefutable evidence of a US government-organized "seminar" held by the US-backed Thai opposition in Thai Parliament, inviting US-funded/backed Myanmar opposition groups including those involved in armed conflict with Myanmar's military/government;

▪️The seminar was opposed by the Thai military which exists as an independent institution, separate from the government, and has repeatedly removed US-backed client regimes put into power in 2006 and 2014 through coups;

▪️I warned that the US would continue cultivating conflict within each Asian nation, and between them through US-backed opposition in each regional nation - as it has in Europe and the Middle East - and now the US-backed opposition in Thailand (one of two factions) is in office and accelerating instability;

▪️The ultimate goal is to create a US-backed united front against China, and short of that, simply destabilize and destroy the region, denying China partners to build constructive ties with, and prevent both China's and Asia's rise (and surpassing of the West);

▪️Today, the ongoing conflict between Thailand-Cambodia represents another manifestation of this - at a time the Myanmar conflict continues, the US continues building up military forces in the Philippines, Japan, and South Korea (as well as the island province of Taiwan);

▪️BRICS/ASEAN need regional/national security laws and agreements to take back regional/national information space from US control, combat US-European political interference, and continue minimizing the West's economic and military leverage used to impose all of the above;
